  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∵</mo></math> Equation of displacement of particle is<br /><br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> .....(i)<br /><br />Or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1001</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>999</mn><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Hence, equation (i) is the result of the superposition of three simple harmonic motion.",
